{
  "key": 13327,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_AskPut100InBinoculars",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a pair of binoculars...\n",
        "Put $100 in it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_NotEnoughMoney",
      "en_US": "Not enough money..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_PokemonDifferFromYesterday",
      "en_US": [
        "Tell me I’m not imagining this...\r",
        "The Great Marsh’s Pokémon seem to be\n",
        "different from the ones yesterday..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_YouCanSeePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Use a pair of binoculars to look out\n",
        "over the Great Marsh.\r",
        "You can see what kinds of Pokémon\n",
        "can be caught, and where they are."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_TakeQuickTrams",
      "en_US": [
        "There are shuttle trains in the\n",
        "marsh called Quick Trams.\r",
        "You should take those if you’re going\n",
        "to a deeper area in the marsh."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_YouCanSinkInBog",
      "en_US": [
        "When you’re walking on the bog,\n",
        "you sometimes sink right in...\r",
        "There’s something pretty cool\n",
        "about it, though.\r",
        "If you turn while you’re stuck,\n",
        "sometimes Pokémon may pop out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_SovereignPoisonMasterIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m the Poison-type Master!\n",
        "I aim to find the ultimate Poison-type!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_SovereignPoisonMasterFail",
      "en_US": [
        "Come at me with only a {COLOR 1}single Pokémon{COLOR 0}\n",
        "in your party if you want to battle me.\r",
        "Oh, and there’s one other condition...\n",
        "That Pokémon must be a {COLOR 1}Poison-type{COLOR 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_SovereignPoisonMasterAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Poison-type looks pretty strong!\r",
        "Should we find out who has the\n",
        "ultimate Poison-type Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_SovereignPoisonMasterBattle",
      "en_US": "Time for a Poison-type battle!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_SovereignPoisonMasterWin",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, wow.\r",
        "It seems the ultimate Poison-type\n",
        "Pokémon belongs to you!\r",
        "That means you are the rightful owner\n",
        "of this precious item!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_SovereignPoisonMasterLose",
      "en_US": [
        "The ultimate Poison-type Pokémon\n",
        "belongs to me!\r",
        "But I’m always ready for another\n",
        "Poison-type battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_SovereignPoisonMasterThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you for a great Poison-type\n",
        "Pokémon battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_SovereignPoisonMasterDecline",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm...\n",
        "Do you feel like you can’t win?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
